# File catalog
; A tiny in-memory catalog of example files.

The catalog lists **two** files and changes //nothing// on disk.

## Entries
- ``notes.md``: 120 bytes
- ``letter.eml``: 240 bytes

~ fb examples
| Labels are printed, never written back.

See https://example.com/catalog for more.[1]

[1] The sizes are made up.
